    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into a world on the brink of death.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insomnia</strong> is a game that blends urban exploration and horror. Choose your path, create your own story, survive, and complete the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you\u2019ll need to collect items to progress through the levels and navigate various challenges.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living, Detailed World </strong>\u2013<strong>\u00a0</strong>Explore diverse environments filled with mysteries to uncover and rich visual details.<strong>-</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Enchanting Soundscape\u00a0</strong>\u2013 An original soundtrack and carefully crafted sound design enhance the immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Yet Engaging Gameplay\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Enjoy a smooth and intuitive experience designed to offer both challenge and satisfaction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't wait any longer dive straight into the abyss.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538060/extras/7c932cf2b0d0f906c358aa0984fe351a.avif?t=1755197178\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
